==Latin==

===Etymology===
{{PIE root|la|gʷerH}}
From {{der|la|ine-pro||*gʷr̥Htos}}, {{m|ine-pro|*gʷerH-||to welcome, greet, praise}}. Cognates include {{cog|sa|गृणाति|tr=gṛṇā́ti||to praise}}, {{cog|cu|жрьти|tr=žrĭti}} and {{cog|prg|girtwei||to praise}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{la-IPA|grātus}}

===Adjective===
{{la-adj-1&2|grātus|grāta|grātum}}

# [[pleasing]], [[acceptable]], [[agreeable]], [[welcome]]
# [[dear]], [[beloved]]
# [[grateful]], [[thankful]]

====Inflection====
{{la-decl-1&2|grāt}}

* ''comparative'': '''[[gratior|grātior]]''', ''superlative'': '''[[gratissimus|grātissimus]]'''

